# PR product demos

For **complex features** or **user-facing behavioral changes**, the PR is not review-ready until it includes a **product demo** that shows the feature working end-to-end.

## Required evidence

- Record or capture on the **Cursor Cloud VM** (not local-only proof when cloud is available).
- Attach walkthrough media to the PR so reviewers can validate without a checkout:
  - Prefer **screen recording** (`.mp4`) for flows; **screenshots** for static UI.
  - Artifacts must be **embedded in the PR description** (inline video/images), not only on the agent run dashboard or in chat.
- Use git-ignored paths (`.tmp/`, etc.) for capture files; never commit demo binaries.
- **Pacing:** After each visible state or behavior change (panel open, tab switch, message sent, error shown, etc.), **pause at least 2 seconds** on that state before moving to the next demo step so reviewers can read and follow the transition.

## How to attach

Follow [obsidian-cloud-vm-demos](../../skills/obsidian-cloud-vm-demos/SKILL.md): Cloud Agent artifact posting and/or `gh pr edit --body-file … --attach ./demo.mp4`.

Functional BDD verification (happy + unhappy paths, PASS/FAIL report with failure explanations): delegate **`/ui-verifier-demo`** per [trigger-ui-verifier-demo](./trigger-ui-verifier-demo.mdc) and [obsidian-ui-verifier-demo](../../skills/obsidian-ui-verifier-demo/SKILL.md). Include `ui-verifier-demo-report.md` in PR or chat when behavioral scope is large.

## When it can be skipped

Local-only request, zero UI/behavior impact, or cloud demo blocked (env/secrets) — say what was verified instead.
